{# "Tienes que aceptar los términos…" at the TOP of the sign-up form (with
   the form's own errors), not under the box: the box is the last field and
   the page comes back scrolled to the top. The box itself stays marked
   invalid and points here (aria-describedby, security/_accept_terms).
   `field`: the form's acceptTerms; `domain`: its message's domain. #}
{% if field.vars.errors|length > 0 %}
    <ul class="errors form-errors accept-terms-errors" role="alert" id="{{ field.vars.id }}_errors">
        {% for error in field.vars.errors %}
            <li>{{ error.messageTemplate|trans(error.messageParameters, domain) }}</li>
        {% endfor %}
    </ul>
{% endif %}
